{"created": "2025-01-31T11:51:41.425155+00:00", "modified": "2025-01-31T11:56:04.363938+00:00", "id": 14779119, "conceptrecid": "14779118", "doi": "10.20394/dqmgka2s", "doi_url": "https://doi.org/10.20394/dqmgka2s", "metadata": {"title": "Bus Open Data Service GTFS archive", "doi": "10.20394/dqmgka2s", "publication_date": "2023-08-17", "description": "<p>This dataset consists of an archive of timetables data originally published by the <a href=\"https://www.bus-data.dft.gov.uk/\">Bus Open Data Service</a> in the General Transit Feed Specification (GTFS) standard. The information mainly reflects local public transport services, such as bus, tram, and ferry. It covers all regions in Great Britain.</p>\n<p>The archive is compiled by taking snapshots of the GTFS data published since 2021. From February 2023, regular snapshots have been taken every Saturday and Tuesday. The timetables data provides specific details, such as the number, day, date, route, and time.</p>\n<p>The time period coverage of this version is from 2021 to 2023, with consistency since February 2023.</p>", "access_right": "open", "creators": [{"name": "Urban Big Data Centre", "affiliation": null}], "contributors": [{"name": "Verduzco Torres, Jose Rafael", "affiliation": "University of Glasgow", "type": "DataCollector", "orcid": "0000-0002-1324-1714"}], "version": "2023.1", "resource_type": {"title": "Dataset", "type": "dataset"}, "grants": [{"code": "ES/S007105/1", "internal_id": "10.13039/100014013::ES/S007105/1", "funder": {"name": "UK Research and Innovation", "doi": "10.13039/100014013", "acronym": "UKRI"}, "title": "Urban Big Data Centre"}, {"code": "ES/L011921/1", "internal_id": "10.13039/100014013::ES/L011921/1", "funder": {"name": "UK Research and Innovation", "doi": "10.13039/100014013", "acronym": "UKRI"}, "title": "Urban Big Data"}], "communities": [{"id": "ubdc-technical-and-working-papers"}], "relations": {"version": [{"index": 0, "is_last": true, "parent": {"pid_type": "recid", "pid_valu